  "headline": "André Luiz and Calvin Harris lift Sporting Kansas City past Houston Dynamo FC 2-0",
  "dek": "The team at the bottom of the 30-club MLS table scored with both of its first-half shots, then played out a goalless second half after Héctor Herrera’s red card.",
  "sections": [
