    "paragraphs": [
     "Houston Dynamo FC finished with 21 shots to Sporting Kansas City’s 10 and held a 68 per cent share of all attempts. The teams nevertheless finished level with four shots on target each. Sporting Kansas City turned two of those four accurate efforts into goals, while its goalkeeper saved all four that came the other way; Houston Dynamo FC’s goalkeeper made two saves.",
     "The location data adds another layer to that contrast. Houston Dynamo FC took 15 shots from inside the penalty area and six from outside, compared with seven inside and three outside for Sporting Kansas City. The visitors’ average located shot distance was 16.5 metres, slightly closer than Houston Dynamo FC’s 17.4 metres. Houston Dynamo FC also led eight to three in corners, but neither the territorial restarts nor the larger shot count produced a goal."
