     "Houston Dynamo FC stayed sixth on 44 points after 27 matches, while its goal difference moved from plus four to plus two. Its five preceding league results contained three draws, one win and one defeat, most recently a 2-2 draw with FC Cincinnati. The positions therefore did not change, but the bottom side collected the points from a contest against a team 24 places above it at kickoff."
